& [CanonicalRecord: P6SurfaceProjectionSystemFinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for P6 surface projection system final slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 7cb3e0d9-6fd3-4a9e-9e9a-4bdd371424ea
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 23208a10-038c-4f20-b668-0fdb4d4e4c42
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is 0be20e07-55b2-469e-b0be-31572e301a36
  + [authority_scope] is P6 final slice order, projection obligation inventory, authority notice rendering, freshness and stale visibility, nonpromotion rendering, checkpoint nonauthority display, interrupt and handoff display, multi-surface projection envelope, surface-specific boundaries, inbound action classification, surface mutation boundary, projection fixture snapshot planning, generated projection nonpromotion, adapter and Langflow dependency deferral, implementation activation boundary, completion review obligations, model routing, and safety limits
  + [implementation_scope] is P6 slice-minting authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/P2_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/P4_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/P5_Completion_Review.v1.sop
